## 7. Package.json Scripts (Updated)

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "seed:vehicles": "node seeds/run-seeds.js seed vehicles",
    "seed:vehicles:reset": "node seeds/run-seeds.js reset --force && npm run seed:vehicles",
    "validate:vehicles": "psql -d parking_management -f seeds/validate_vehicles.sql"
  }
}